WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.312
Is there a way

00:00:01.312 --> 00:00:03.850
for the digital 
experiences that&nbsp;we create

00:00:04.253 --> 00:00:06.390
to truly enrich our physical lives?

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:09.014
That digital culture would be described today

00:00:09.014 --> 00:00:11.295
as an augmented reality metaverse.

00:00:11.295 --> 00:00:13.529
We could use this tool to simply

00:00:13.529 --> 00:00:14.817
cover the world.

00:00:14.817 --> 00:00:16.304
Or&nbsp;we could use it

00:00:16.304 --> 00:00:18.316
to further connect us to this world.

00:00:18.316 --> 00:00:20.116
You could leave a digital artwork

00:00:20.116 --> 00:00:22.332
on the street corner for your lover to find.

00:00:22.332 --> 00:00:25.134
You could reinvent your backyard with
 an&nbsp;animated treasure hunt 

00:00:25.134 --> 00:00:27.555
for your kids and their friends.

00:00:27.555 --> 00:00:29.000
The digital worlds we build

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:32.352
can be a&nbsp;wonderful playground 
for exploring identity,

00:00:32.352 --> 00:00:33.717
for learning new skills,

00:00:33.717 --> 00:00:35.618
for practicing&nbsp;creativity

00:00:35.618 --> 00:00:37.579
and bringing our communities together.

